[Desktop Entry]
Name=文档敏感词批量清除工具
Name[en]=Doc Internal Word Remover
Comment=批量清除文档首尾行的涉密标识（涉密/内部/秘密/机密/绝密），纯本地运行，数据不出本机
Comment[en]=Batch-remove sensitive words from documents locally
Exec=bash -c 'cd "$(dirname %k)" && bash Start.sh'
Icon=app-icon
Terminal=true
Type=Application
Categories=Office;Utility;
StartupNotify=true
